    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting in was the easy part.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You squeezed under the door, tiptoed between the sleeping guard's legs,  climbed up into the rafters, and scoured the room. That's when you spied it: <strong>The</strong>\u00a0<strong>Treasure</strong>. Weeks of covert observation had paid off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now what?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't big  enough to lift it. And there's only one way out. But there's <i>sooo\u00a0</i>much junk in the way. Someone needs to teach these greedy hoarders about Spring cleaning! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So make a plan... Or don't... And start pushing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't feel <i>too</i> bad about it. They're the real crooks (plus one kleptomaniac bird!), not you. You're just a <strong>Pocket Thief!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty  to get your mitts on: <br>60 hand-crafted, Klotski-style puzzles that gradually become more complex, including 10 bonus levels with special rewards, AND a random level selector!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots to see (and steal!):<br>5 hand-drawn, uniquely themed stages; with each level filled with  interesting objects in a variety of shapes and one piece of sweet, sweet loot.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time restrictions or move limits:  <br>Take your time and meticulously plan your moves out in advance, or don't; its up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited skips:   <br>Start with a couple of skips and replenish your stock by completing other levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay levels to try and improve your rating:<br>Fewer moves = better rating. Can you achieve perfect efficiency on every level?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your Secret Hideout: <br>Complete bonus levels to unlock animal trophies and proudly arrange them in your (not so) secret hideout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls:   <br>Play using mouse only. Click, hold, drag, and release.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surround sounds: <br>Music changes to match the setting as you progress through the stages. </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Getting in was the easy part.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You squeezed under the door, tiptoed between the sleeping guard's legs,  climbed up into the rafters, and scoured the room. That's when you spied it: <strong>The</strong>\u00a0<strong>Treasure</strong>. Weeks of covert observation had paid off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now what?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You aren't big  enough to lift it. And there's only one way out. But there's <i>sooo\u00a0</i>much junk in the way. Someone needs to teach these greedy hoarders about Spring cleaning! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So make a plan... Or don't... And start pushing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don't feel <i>too</i> bad about it. They're the real crooks (plus one kleptomaniac bird!), not you. You're just a <strong>Pocket Thief!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty  to get your mitts on: <br>60 hand-crafted, Klotski-style puzzles that gradually become more complex, including 10 bonus levels with special rewards, AND a random level selector!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots to see (and steal!):<br>5 hand-drawn, uniquely themed stages; with each level filled with  interesting objects in a variety of shapes and one piece of sweet, sweet loot.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time restrictions or move limits:  <br>Take your time and meticulously plan your moves out in advance, or don't; its up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited skips:   <br>Start with a couple of skips and replenish your stock by completing other levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay levels to try and improve your rating:<br>Fewer moves = better rating. Can you achieve perfect efficiency on every level?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your Secret Hideout: <br>Complete bonus levels to unlock animal trophies and proudly arrange them in your (not so) secret hideout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls:   <br>Play using mouse only. Click, hold, drag, and release.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surround sounds: <br>Music changes to match the setting as you progress through the stages. </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Slide your way to becoming a master thief, as you steal from the rich, and keep a little something for yourself; in this criminally fun 2D puzzle game. Navigate natural barriers and drag obstacles thoughtfully away until you can successfully guide the loot out of each maze-like level.",
